sdl2: preserve precise wheel movement through virtio input

Port the Windows runtime's 0018 patch to QEMU 11.1.1. Its internal
QemuInputEvent uses inline fields rather than QAPI event pointers.
SDL positive X means right and positive Y means up. Preserve delivered
values for SDL_MOUSEWHEEL_FLIPPED too: Linux compositors already apply the
host scroll preference. Ignore direction as upstream QEMU does.
Keep PS/2 and USB on accumulated whole-detent buttons.

